   the session `gtboth` (UART IRQ 4 and RTC IRQ 8 pending together): the acknowledge returns 8 (line 2 outranks line 4), HEAD's
   flat scan returns 4.  Prescribed mutant D_gt_noassign: `if (n >= 0) odata = n;` -> `;`.  Expected: killed by `gtboth iack`.
