The new discriminator rows support the three intended repairs. Three companion rows stay green under their associated mutants, so they provide supporting state evidence rather than independent kills. I also found a chronology correction: the v2f mutant sweep overlapped the v2g witness and fix runs, though it finished before the v2g table of record.
